  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4305.01 Testing Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4305.01 Testing Required. The owner or operator shall conduct initial and subsequent performance testing at each existing OSWI unit for which the owner or operator is responsible to determine compliance with the emissions limits specified in Table 4303-1 and pursuant to Env-A 800.\n\nSource. #8787, eff 1-5-07; ss by #10765, eff 1-22-15; ss by #14248, eff 5-20-25, EXPIRES: 5-20-35",
